# 🚀 Overview

CyberWolf Sentinel Pro provides a centralized platform for performing authorized reconnaissance and security assessments.

The framework combines multiple security modules into one professional terminal application, allowing users to collect information, inspect web technologies, review security configurations, and generate assessment results efficiently.

