# ⚙ Installation

## 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/rashidabdullah5737-ai/CyberWolf-Sentinel-Pro.git
cd CyberWolf-Sentinel-Pro
```

---

## 2️⃣ Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
```

---

## 3️⃣ Activate Virtual Environment

### Kali Linux / Ubuntu / macOS

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```

### Windows

```cmd
venv\Scripts\activate
```

---

## 4️⃣ Upgrade pip

```bash
pip install --upgrade pip
```

---

## 5️⃣ Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## 6️⃣ Launch the Framework

```bash
python3 main.py
```

---

## 7️⃣ Exit Virtual Environment

```bash
deactivate
```

---

